  --tailscale <mode>                       Tailscale: off|serve|funnel
  --install-daemon                         Install gateway service
  --no-install-daemon                      Skip gateway service install
  --skip-daemon                            Skip gateway service install
  --daemon-runtime <runtime>               Daemon runtime: node
  --skip-channels                          Skip channel setup
  --skip-skills                            Skip skills setup
  --skip-bootstrap                         Skip creating default agent workspace files
  --skip-search                            Skip search provider setup
  --skip-health                            Skip health check
  --skip-ui                                Skip Control UI/TUI prompts
  --suppress-gateway-token-output          Disable the guided Control UI handoff
  --skip-hooks                             Skip hook setup
  --node-manager <name>                    Node manager for skills: npm|pnpm|bun
  --import-from <provider>                 Migration provider to run during onboarding
  --import-source <path>                   Source agent home for --import-from
  --import-secrets                         Import supported secrets during onboarding migration (default: false)
  --json                                   Output JSON summary (default: false)
  -h, --help                               display help for command

Commands:
  recommendations [options]                Read the app recommendations stored during onboarding

Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/onboard

Usage: openclaw agents [options] [command]

Manage isolated agents (workspaces + auth + routing)

Options:
  -h, --help              display help for command

Commands:
  list [options]          List configured agents
  bindings [options]      List routing bindings
  bind [options]          Add routing bindings for an agent
  unbind [options]        Remove routing bindings for an agent
  add [options] [name]    Add a new isolated agent
  set-identity [options]  Update an agent identity (name/theme/emoji/avatar)
  delete [options] <id>   Delete an agent and prune workspace/state

Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agents

Usage: openclaw secrets [options] [command]

Secrets runtime controls

Options:
  -h, --help           display help for command

Commands:
  store                Manage the team-scoped SQLite secret and environment
                       store
  reload [options]     Re-resolve secret references and atomically swap runtime
                       snapshot
  audit [options]      Audit plaintext secrets, unresolved refs, and precedence
                       drift
  configure [options]  Interactive secrets helper (provider setup + SecretRef
                       mapping + preflight)
  apply [options]      Apply a previously generated secrets plan
  help [command]       display help for command

Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/gateway/security

